WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.510
A football crowd behaves in a pattern you can learn and predict.

2
00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:16.260
It arrives late - most fans come in the last hour, and the biggest rush is in the last thirty minutes before kick-off.

3
00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:23.290
It feels the match - one goal, one red card, can change the mood in seconds.

4
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:31.360
It moves all at once - to the concourses at half-time, and to the exits at the final whistle.

5
00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:45.550
It's loyal and loud: flags, drums, songs - and here there will be fans of two teams, neutral fans and many families.

6
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:56.050
And sometimes it brings problems with it: flares, rival groups, or people without tickets pushing at the gates.
